{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/compare/master...6d8f7882ae6e7b7b86697474ee1a3755dfba1858","html_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/compare/master...6d8f7882ae6e7b7b86697474ee1a3755dfba1858","permalink_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/compare/FFmpeg:4b0fad0...FFmpeg:6d8f788","diff_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/compare/master...6d8f7882ae6e7b7b86697474ee1a3755dfba1858.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/compare/master...6d8f7882ae6e7b7b86697474ee1a3755dfba1858.patch","base_commit":{"sha":"4b0fad0c61a9ba93e7bc8a469dac8ff208a45d7b","node_id":"C_kwDOABiiStoAKDRiMGZhZDBjNjFhOWJhOTNlN2JjOGE0NjlkYWM4ZmYyMDhhNDVkN2I","commit":{"author":{"name":"Baptiste Coudurier","email":"baptiste.coudurier@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-12T21:40:38Z"},"committer":{"name":"Baptiste Coudurier","email":"baptiste.coudurier@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-12T22:28:14Z"},"message":"avcodec/svq1dec: set the key flag on intra frames\n\nIntra frames are self-contained and were only marked as\nAV_PICTURE_TYPE_I, so every decoded SVQ1 frame had key_frame=0 and\nplayers waiting for a keyframe never showed the video.\n\nFixes #25938.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Baptiste Coudurier <baptiste.coudurier@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"257b6f81fc8886f5cab0425505aa3c88573f9326","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/git/trees/257b6f81fc8886f5cab0425505aa3c88573f9326"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/git/commits/4b0fad0c61a9ba93e7bc8a469dac8ff208a45d7b","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commits/4b0fad0c61a9ba93e7bc8a469dac8ff208a45d7b","html_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commit/4b0fad0c61a9ba93e7bc8a469dac8ff208a45d7b","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commits/4b0fad0c61a9ba93e7bc8a469dac8ff208a45d7b/comments","author":{"login":"bcoudurier","id":918644,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxODY0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/918644?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier","html_url":"https://github.com/bcoudurier","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"bcoudurier","id":918644,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxODY0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/918644?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier","html_url":"https://github.com/bcoudurier","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"a948f8e34a21ab457d533fe7ad18ec89fe9d5d07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commits/a948f8e34a21ab457d533fe7ad18ec89fe9d5d07","html_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commit/a948f8e34a21ab457d533fe7ad18ec89fe9d5d07"}]},"merge_base_commit":{"sha":"6d8f7882ae6e7b7b86697474ee1a3755dfba1858","node_id":"C_kwDOABiiStoAKDZkOGY3ODgyYWU2ZTdiN2I4NjY5NzQ3NGVlMWEzNzU1ZGZiYTE4NTg","commit":{"author":{"name":"David Korczynski","email":"david@adalogics.com","date":"2026-05-21T12:48:54Z"},"committer":{"name":"michaelni","email":"michael@niedermayer.cc","date":"2026-06-03T20:33:19Z"},"message":"avcodec/adpcm: require block_align to be a multiple of channels in ADPCM_PSXC init\n\nThe ADPCM_PSXC block loop in adpcm_decode_frame() (libavcodec/adpcm.c:\n2770) iterates 'block < avpkt->size / block_align' times and, for\neach block, consumes\n    channels * (1 + (block_align - 1) / channels)\ninput bytes via the *unchecked* bytestream2_get_byteu() reader. The\nloop divides avpkt->size by block_align, so the loop bound is sound\nonly when the per-block consumption equals block_align — i.e. when\nblock_align is an exact multiple of channels. For any other\ncombination (e.g. block_align=9 with channels=8), each block consumes\nmore than block_align bytes; iterating avpkt->size/block_align\nblocks then walks the input bytestream past avpkt->data +\navpkt->size, producing the heap-buffer-overflow READ at\nlibavcodec/bytestream.h:99 reported as ANT-2026-04052.\n\nadpcm_decode_init() previously only enforced 'channels > 0' and\n'block_align > 0' for PSXC. Tighten the init check to additionally\nrequire 'block_align % channels == 0', which is the precise\ninvariant the decode loop depends on.\n\nReproducer: a crafted WAV header declaring channels=8, block_align=9\nwith the decoder forced via 'ffmpeg -c:a adpcm_psxc -i evil.wav'.\n\nFound-by: Anthropic agents; validated and reported by Ada Logics.\n\nSigned-off-by: David Korczynski <david@adalogics.com>","tree":{"sha":"4df64663b8153474ca83305a01a6d3115e175f56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/git/trees/4df64663b8153474ca83305a01a6d3115e175f56"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/git/commits/6d8f7882ae6e7b7b86697474ee1a3755dfba1858","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commits/6d8f7882ae6e7b7b86697474ee1a3755dfba1858","html_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commit/6d8f7882ae6e7b7b86697474ee1a3755dfba1858","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commits/6d8f7882ae6e7b7b86697474ee1a3755dfba1858/comments","author":{"login":"DavidKorczynski","id":657617,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzYxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/657617?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKorczynski","html_url":"https://github.com/DavidKorczynski","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKorczynski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKorczynski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKorczynski/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKorczynski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKorczynski/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKorczynski/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKorczynski/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKorczynski/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKorczynski/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"michaelni","id":729390,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyOTM5MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/729390?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelni","html_url":"https://github.com/michaelni","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mi